@orz/ui-json

Parts of this package are ported from two projects, rewritten from Vue and
Svelte into React and extended (token selection, comments from JSONC and
JSON5 sources, replaceable labels):

- The tree model, the row layout, the search, the summaries and the inspect
  panel (src/tree.ts, src/summary.ts, src/tool-format.ts, src/json-view.tsx,
  src/json-row.tsx, src/inspect-dialog.tsx) are ported from PicoTera,
  https://github.com/oott123/picotera, dashboard/src/components/json-viewer/
  and dashboard/src/lib/toolFormat.ts at commit a275165, licensed under the
  BSD 3-Clause License.

- The selection logic (src/selection.ts) is ported from vanilla-jsoneditor
  v3.12.0, https://github.com/josdejong/svelte-jsoneditor,
  src/lib/logic/selection.ts, licensed under the ISC License.

